  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.AptosOASIS v2.0.5\n\nConnects the OASIS to Aptos -- built by ex-Meta Diem engineers using Move, AptosBFT consensus, and Block-STM parallel execution for up to 160,000 TPS. Stores OASIS holons and avatars with high-speed finality. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.4\n- fix(aptos): retain identity selector failures before deletion (f935f83)\n- Implement Aptos account CQL with explicit per-query ledger version (5dc7e0a)\n- Integrate retained Aptos CQL demo and verify native Mongo federation (122a9eb)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Recover Aptos CQL demo and strict canonical SDK acknowledgement decoding (e06ba6d)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.AptosOASIS",
